WiFi firmware for the Broadcom/Cypress BCM43430 and CYW43455 FullMAC SDIO
chips, as fitted to the Raspberry Pi 3 Model B and Raspberry Pi 5. Installed
to \SystemRoot\system32\drivers\brcm\ and loaded by the cyw43455 driver
during chip bring-up.

